THIRD-PARTY DATA

The dictionary content is built on the work of others. Those materials are
not covered by the copyright notice above and stay under the terms set by
their authors:

  src/data/dictionary.json, dictionary.pdf
      Adapted from the Tamazight-English Dictionary of the Zaouiat Ahansal
      dialect (2016), by Cloe M. Erickson and Ismail Barda of the Atlas
      Cultural Foundation, building on the work of Stacy Alboher, Laurel
      Groh and Eric Poolman. Its authors invite others to adapt it.

  src/data/wiktionary_words.json
      From Wiktionary, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
      (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). This file and any
      changes made to it are shared under the same licence.

  src/data/tatoeba_examples.json, src/data/tatoeba_words.json
      From the Tatoeba corpus (https://tatoeba.org), licensed under
      CC BY 2.0 FR (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/).

  src/data/ircam_verbs.json
      Verb conjugation data from the Institut Royal de la Culture Amazighe
      (IRCAM), under the Apache License 2.0.

  src/assets/NotoSansTifinagh-Regular.ttf
      Noto Sans Tifinagh, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

